 value\\)#{2}":[1006,1006],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeBooleanField\\(String fieldName, Boolean value\\)#{3}":[1007,1008],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeBooleanField\\(String fieldName, Boolean value\\)#{4}":[1009,1060],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeFieldName\\(String name\\)":[1061,1124],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeFieldName\\(String name\\)#{1}":[1063,1124],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeNull\\(\\)":[1125,1184],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeNull\\(\\)#{1}":[1127,1184],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeNullField\\(String fieldName\\)":[1185,1243],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeNullField\\(String fieldName\\)#{1}":[1187,1243],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeNumberField\\(String fieldName, String encodedValue\\)":[1244,1308],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeNumberField\\(String fieldName, String encodedValue\\)#{1}":[1246,1308],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeRaw\\(String text\\)":[1309,1368],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeRaw\\(String text\\)#{1}":[1311,1368],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeString\\(String text\\)":[1369,1432],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeString\\(String text\\)#{1}":[1371,1432],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeStringField\\(String fieldName, String value\\)":[1433,1498],"#JSONStreamingAPI- Scoped#JSONStreamingAPI - writeStringField\\(String fieldName, String value\\)#{1}":[1435,1498]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Script step","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/build-workflows/javascript-step-action-designer.md","line":26},{"title":"JSONStreamingBuilder - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/JSONStreamingBuilderScopedAPI.md","line":30},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":181},{"title":"JSONStreamingBuilder - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/JSONStreamingBuilderScopedAPI.md","line":544},{"title":"JSONStreamingBuilder - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/JSONStreamingBuilderScopedAPI.md","line":610}],"metadata":{"title":"JSONStreamingAPI - Scoped","description":"Build a large streaming JSON payload to use in a REST or SOAP request to send bulk data to a third-party API. You can also create the payload as a JSON string for a non-streaming option.Closes the JSONStreamingAPI object. Must call this method to close the stream after building a JSON object.Ends pretty print JSON formatting.Adds pretty print formatting to a JSON object, or a section of a JSON object.Closes an array within the parent JSON object.Closes an object within the parent JSON object.Returns the sys\\_id of the attachment record in the Streaming Attachments \\[streaming\\_attachment\\] table that contains the JSON payload.Returns the JSON object as a string.Opens an array within the parent JSON object.Creates an array within the parent JSON object.Opens an object within the parent JSON object.Adds a Boolean value to the parent JSON object.Adds a Boolean field and value to the parent JSON object.Adds a field name to the parent JSON object.Adds a null value to the parent JSON object.Adds a field with a null value to the parent JSON object.Adds a number field and value to the parent JSON object.Adds a raw value to the parent JSON object.Adds a string value to the parent JSON object.Adds a string field and value to the parent JSON object.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/JSONStreamingAPIScopedAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":20,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[65,113],[117,156],[160,179],[197,245],[263,309],[313,321],[337,383],[387,406],[424,472],[490,538],[556,604],[620,664],[668,687],[705,753],[769,814],[832,880],[918,964],[1014,1059],[1075,1123],[1137,1183],[1197,1242],[1259,1307],[1321,1367],[1383,1431],[1448,1496]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/JSONStreamingAPIScopedAPI.md"},
